          </paramlist><![CDATA[TEST PROFILES (starts from 1, offset by testNumMin):
____________________ 
Implemented by the lookup tables, left-right, top-bottom
(scr [0=no zth], xr_ratio, Pmain, PduplicateSt, Pduplicate, load)

1. AGS-ESR: small voltage disturbance: 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0 (ext.)
2. AGS-ESR: frequency change+inertia: 3, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0
3. System Strength - SCR: 10, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0; handled externally, breaker will be open (ext.)
4. Phase Angle Jump: 3, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0
5. Loss of synch. machine - Disch.: 0, 0, 0.3, 1, 0.1, 1.3
6. Loss of synch. machine - Chrg.: 0, 0, 0.6, 1, 0.4, 0.7
7. Loss of synch. machine - Dupl. Pmax: 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1.65]]></Sticky>
