            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[Profile:
1.  Flatstart
2.  LVRT
3.  HVRT
4.  V-down
5.  V-up
6.  LVRT (ieee2800)
7.  LVRT (ieee2800 piece-wise)
8.  HVRT (ieee2800)
9.  HVRT w/ transient 2800
10.  Angle down
11.  Angle up

19. AGS-ESR PAJ

The LVRT tests (profiles 6 and 7) have two profiles, WGR and PVGR, depending on the Wind or Solar / Energy Storage flag on the main PMView block.]]></Sticky>
