        <Sticky classid="Sticky" x="0" y="0" w="486" h="198" id="1052165179">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="arrows" value="0" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="15792890" />
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 8pt" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
            <param name="fg_color_adv" value="#FF000000" />
            <param name="bg_color_adv" value="#FFFAFAF0" />
            <param name="hl_color_adv" value="#FFFFFF00" />
            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[PMView - Version 2.5 March 2026

Scott Zuloaga and Jonathan Rose and Yunzhi Cheng
scott.zuloaga@ercot.com, Jonathan.Rose@ercot.com, yunzhi.cheng@ercot.com 

https://sites.google.com/view/pmview

To understand the different Test Profiles, look inside the sub-blocks or watch the website videos. Profile number adjustments will require updates to contants within this block.

  -- Profile 1 - 11     :  V&Angle block, Profiles 12~13: Frequency block
  -- Profile 14          :  SCR block
  -- Profile 15          : PMU/DFR data playback
  -- Profile 16 - 22   : AGS-ESR (SCR, PAJ still implemented in normal blocks)]]></Sticky>
        <Sticky classid="Sticky" id="1246399763" x="612" y="18" w="252" h="450" colors="0, 15792890">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 10pt" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="8454016" />
            <param name="arrows" value="4" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
            <param name="fg_color_adv" value="#FF000000" />
            <param name="bg_color_adv" value="#FF80FF80" />
            <param name="hl_color_adv" value="#FFFFFF00" />
            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[TEST PROFILES:
____________________
1.  Flatstart
2.  LVRT
3.  HVRT
4.  V-down
5.  V-up
6.  LVRT (ieee2800)
7.  LVRT (ieee2800 piece-wise)
8.  HVRT (ieee2800)
9.  HVRT w/ transient 2800
10.  Angle down
11.  Angle up
12.  Frequency Down
13.  Frequency Up
14.  Short Ckt Ratio SCR
15.  PMU playback

16. AGS-ESR: small voltage disturbance
17. AGS-ESR: frequency change+inertia
18. AGS-ESR: System Strength - SCR
19. AGS-ESR: Phase Angle Jump
20. AGS-ESR: Loss of synch. machine - Disch.
21. AGS-ESR: Loss of synch. machine - Chrg.
22. AGS-ESR: Loss of synch. machine - Dupl. Pmax]]></Sticky>
